    "main": "<main id=\"main\" class=\"page\">\n  <header class=\"wrap page-head\">\n    <nav class=\"crumbs\" aria-label=\"Breadcrumb\"><a href=\"index.html\">Home</a><i></i><span aria-current=\"page\">Legal</span></nav>\n    <h1 class=\"outline page-title\">Legal</h1>\n    <p class=\"lead\">How this website handles your data, how we use photos of students, and who made what.</p>\n  </header>\n\n  <section class=\"wrap section--tight\" style=\"padding-top:0\">\n    <div class=\"legal\">\n      <section class=\"glass\" id=\"privacy\" data-reveal>\n        <h2>Privacy policy</h2>\n        <p>This website does not use cookies, ads or tracking. It does not collect any personal data from visitors.</p>\n        <p>The fonts, maps, photos and videos are stored on this website. Your browser does not connect to Google or other companies to show them. Only videos that we embed from <span class=\"ph-txt\">[Google Drive / YouTube]</span> load from that service.</p>\n        <p>The website is hosted by <span class=\"ph-txt\">[GitHub Pages / Cloudflare]</span>. Like every web host, they may keep short technical logs.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"glass\" id=\"photos\" data-reveal>\n        <h2>Photo consent</h2>\n        <p>We only publish photos and videos of students who agreed to it. For students under 18, a parent agreed too.</p>\n        <p>Do you want a photo removed? Write to <span class=\"ph-txt\">[email@example.com]</span> and we will take it down.</p>\n      </section>\n      <section class=\"glass\" id=\"credits\" data-reveal>\n        <h2>Credits</h2>\n        <ul>\n          <li>Design and code: the website team of Colegiul Național „Johannes Honterus”.</li>\n          <li>Logo: <span class=\"ph-txt\">[Name]</span>.</li>\n          <li>Photos and videos: the students and teachers of the three schools.</li>\n          <li>Background video on the home page: <span class=\"ph-txt\">[source]</span>.</li>\n          <li>Fonts: Big Shoulders Display and Inter. On the home page also Titan One, Sedgwick Ave Display, Press Start 2P, Fredoka, Abril Fatface, Pacifico, Bungee, Monoton, Lobster, Bangers, Creepster, UnifrakturCook, Righteous, Black Ops One, VT323, Orbitron, Alfa Slab One, Rye, Amatic SC, Cinzel Decorative, Playfair Display, Rubik Mono One, Dancing Script, Shrikhand and Audiowide. All under the SIL Open Font License.</li>\n          <li>Map data: Natural Earth (public domain).</li>\n        </ul>\n      </section>\n    </div>\n  </section>\n</main>"
